  (text "ADS7038 AIN6 = buffered input-current monitor; AIN7 = ACT rail voltage. GPIO1 = isolated, active-low VBUS presence (Q3).\nVoltage scale = 22.1 / 122.1. Current scale = 182 uA/A x effective ILM resistance; changes with CC state.\nUse raw CC status with each sample; discard mode-transition samples and calibrate offset/gain. ACT voltage-filter tau ~1.81 ms; D4 limits off-state ADC injection."
